# README.template.md is SOURCE (GitPublisherWorker renders README.md from it in
# the build-output FreeProxyList working repo) and must be version-controlled.
# It was previously ignored here, which kept the live template out of the repo
# entirely - un-ignored as part of WP5 (open hotlinkable endpoints) so the
# template edits ship with the branch. Runtime artifacts (README.md, *.txt,
# by-country/) are only ever written to the bin output copy, never here.
